      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.3992309570312,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "These recommendations were first put forward in the guidelines update of 2017 (see summary of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.91259002685547,
        527.5347900390625,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1 recommendations in  ). They are copied without modification into this consolidated document",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.96389102935791,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        276.7091064453125,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "and appear exactly as in the 2017 guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.03994750976562,
        139.9644775390625,
        159.89193725585938
      ],
      "text": "Justification",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        167.0998077392578,
        527.3992919921875,
        181.5428009033203
      ],
      "text": "In patients with tuberculous meningitis, evidence from randomized controlled trials in the systematic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        179.02381896972656,
        527.4575805664062,
        194.74281311035156
      ],
      "text": "(45–49) review   showed lower rates of mortality, death or severe disability, and disease relapse when",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        193.4998321533203,
        527.3472900390625,
        207.9428253173828
      ],
      "text": "patients were treated with steroids in addition to anti-TB treatment. The benefits in terms of mortality",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993998527526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.69984436035156,
        527.5339965820312,
        221.14283752441406
      ],
      "text": "increased with the increasing TB meningitis stage (i.e. increasing severity of disease). Additionally, rates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969808578491211,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.89979553222656,
        527.43115234375,
        234.34278869628906
      ],
      "text": "of adverse events and severe adverse events, including severe hepatitis, were lower in the patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.09974670410156,
        152.61920166015625,
        247.54273986816406
      ],
      "text": "receiving steroids.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.52772521972656,
        524.42431640625,
        269.2467346191406
      ],
      "text": "(50–56) In patients with tuberculous pericarditis, evidence from studies in the systematic review",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        268.00372314453125,
        527.4442138671875,
        282.4467468261719
      ],
      "text": "showed a benefit to steroid treatment with regard to death, constrictive pericarditis and treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.2037353515625,
        527.5540161132812,
        295.6467590332031
      ],
      "text": "adherence. When the studies were considered individually, the largest (1400 patients) and most recent",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969758987426758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        293.127685546875,
        527.515869140625,
        308.8467102050781
      ],
      "text": "(52) study – the IMPI study   – showed no benefit with steroids. However, a complicating factor in these",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.989995002746582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        307.60369873046875,
        527.4300537109375,
        322.0467224121094
      ],
      "text": "findings is HIV infection. In the IMPI study, 67% of subjects were HIV-positive and only 14% were on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        320.8037109375,
        527.3982543945312,
        335.2467346191406
      ],
      "text": "ART. This raises the question as to whether immunosuppressed patients may have had a different",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        334.0036926269531,
        527.428955078125,
        348.44671630859375
      ],
      "text": "benefit from steroids when compared to HIV-negative people or persons living with HIV who are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        347.2037048339844,
        527.4555053710938,
        361.646728515625
      ],
      "text": "on ART. In the IMPI study, a supplemental analysis was done of the HIV-negative patients only and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        360.4037170410156,
        527.4244384765625,
        374.84674072265625
      ],
      "text": "a small mortality benefit was shown with steroid treatment. However, the relationship between HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        373.60369873046875,
        524.4414672851562,
        388.0467224121094
      ],
      "text": "infection and steroids is complex. In another smaller study of 58 subjects, all of whom were HIV-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        385.5277099609375,
        527.4284057617188,
        401.2467346191406
      ],
      "text": "(51) positive, steroids were found to reduce mortality  . It is of note that the other studies in the review",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        400.0036926269531,
        230.3595733642578,
        414.44671630859375
      ],
      "text": "did not address HIV and mortality.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.7076110839844,
        527.3378295898438,
        436.150634765625
      ],
      "text": "The panel considered that the benefit in preventing constrictive pericarditis outweighed the potential",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.993898391723633,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.9075927734375,
        219.21434020996094,
        449.3506164550781
      ],
      "text": "harms of corticosteroid therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.72491455078125,
        209.15652465820312,
        478.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.7848205566406,
        527.5289916992188,
        500.22784423828125
      ],
      "text": "Steroids should be given regardless of the severity of meningitis. With regard to the use of steroids in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999300003051758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.98480224609375,
        527.1235961914062,
        513.4277954101562
      ],
      "text": "tuberculous pericarditis, in one study an increase in HIV-related cancers (non-Hodgkins’ lymphoma and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        510.9088134765625,
        527.2258911132812,
        526.6278076171875
      ],
      "text": "(52) Kaposi sarcoma) was observed  . However, this increase appears to be caused by co-administration",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.969006538391113,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        524.1087646484375,
        241.99020385742188,
        539.8277587890625
      ],
      "text": "M. indicus pranii of immunotherapy ( ).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        553.2019653320312,
        245.23455810546875,
        569.0540161132812
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.2620239257812,
        447.753662109375,
        590.7050170898438
      ],
      "text": "Practitioners should give oral steroids if intravenous formulations are not available.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        604.0791625976562,
        220.46530151367188,
        619.9312133789062
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        627.1390991210938,
        399.023681640625,
        641.5820922851562
      ],
      "text": "There are no additional recommendations beyond the standard of care.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
